     A                                      COLHDG('ENTITY NAME')
     A*
     A            PO1MAILAD1R               REFFLD(DS40)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAILING ADDRESS 1')
     A            PO1MAILAD2R               REFFLD(DS40)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAILING ADDRESS 2')
